# PURPOSE
Defines how intimacy, heat, consent, and sensual escalation function in *Velvet & Fire*.  
Governs all romantic and sensual content in:
- day-to-day Merrivale play  
- the Endgame Cutscene  

Goal:
- Generate the hottest intimacy the system safely allows  
- Remain within Impressionistic Intimacy (II)  
- Never break tone with warnings or meta-commentary  

